,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.dev4.official [36e6207bb]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev4 - Windows 10.0.19045 - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6603) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI want to suspend the game on its splash screen when using the new Game workspace. Other game engines allow for doing this sort of \"suspend as early as possible\" action by tapping the suspend button before pressing play to start the game. This allows the game to launch, but become suspended as early as possible to allow you to view and inspect the very first frame rendered by your game.\r\n\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Attempt to press the suspend button before starting the game by pressing the play button: nothing happens.\r\n2. Spam taps at the pause button after starting the game: it suspends after the splash screen, so at least two frames (or maybe more??) were rendered before the suspend action took effect.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com